  "response": "袋中共有 \\(4+3+2=9\\) 球。抽取 2 球（无放回），总的选择方式为  \n\n\\[\n\\binom{9}{2}=36 .\n\\]\n\n相同颜色的方案：\n\n- 红球：\\(\\binom{4}{2}=6\\)\n- 蓝球：\\(\\binom{3}{2}=3\\)\n- 绿球：\\(\\binom{2}{2}=1\\)\n\n共 \\(6+3+1=10\\) 种。\n\n所以\n\n\\[\nP(\\text{同色})=\\frac{10}{36}=\\frac{5}{18}.\n\\]\n\n**最简分数为 \\(\\displaystyle \\frac{5}{18}\\)。**\n",
  "thinking": "The user writes in Chinese: \"袋中红4蓝3绿2，不放回抽两个，颜色相同概率最简分数。\" Means: There is a bag containing red 4, blue 3, green 2. Draw two balls without replacement. What is the probability that the two drawn balls are of the same color? Express in simplest fraction.\n\nThus we need to compute probability that both drawn balls have same color.\n\nWe have total balls = 4+3+2 = 9.\n\nWe draw 2 without replacement.\n\nNumber of ways to choose 2 balls from 9: C(9,2) = 36.\n\nNumber of favorable outcomes: choose two balls of same color. For each color, number of ways to choose 2 from that color: C(4,2) for red = 6; C(3,2) for blue = 3; C(2,2) for green = 1. Sum = 6+3+1=10.\n\nThus probability = 10/36 = simplify: divide by 2 => 5/18.\n\nThus answer: 5/18.\n\nThus we should answer.\n\nBut we need to be careful: \"颜色相同概率最简分数\" means \"the probability in simplest fraction\". So answer is 5/18.\n\nThus final answer: 5/18.\n\nWe can also show steps if needed.\n\nThus answer: 5/18.\n\nWill answer in Chinese: \"概率 = 5/18\".\n\nThus final.",
